<%- include('partials/admin-header', { title: '엑셀 업로드' , active: 'import' }) %>

    <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between mb-3">
        <div>
            <h3 class="mb-1">엑셀 업로드</h3>
            <div class="text-muted small">엑셀 파일로 상품을 일괄 반영합니다.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex gap-2">
            <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" href="/admin">대시보드</a>
            <a class="btn btn-outline-dark btn-sm" href="/shop/products">상품몰 보기</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <div class="card-header">
            <strong>업로드 파일 선택</strong>
        </div>

        <div class="card-body">
            <div class="alert alert-light border small mb-3">
                <div class="fw-semibold mb-1">엑셀 헤더 예시</div>
                <div class="text-muted">
                    code, name, category_slug(선택), category_name(선택), price, spec, image, description
                </div>
                <div class="text-muted mt-1">
                    ※ category_slug이 없고 category_name만 있으면, 이름으로 slug를 자동 생성하도록 라우트에서 처리하면 됩니다.
                </div>
            </div>

            <form action="/admin/products/import" method="post" enctype="multipart/form-data" class="vstack gap-3">
                <div>
                    <label class="form-label">엑셀 파일(.xlsx)</label>
                    <input class="form-control" type="file" name="file" accept=".xlsx,.xls" required>
                </div>

                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <button class="btn btn-dark" type="submit">업로드 반영</button>
                    <a class="btn btn-outline-secondary" href="/admin/products">이전(상품 관리)</a>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <%- include('partials/admin-footer') %>